{
 "about": "The intro cinematic: the storyteller's script, his voice, the music, the sound effects, the PixelLab scenes and the edit. elevenlabs_gen.py intro and pixellab_gen.py intro make the assets from this file; tools/intro/build_intro.py cuts them into the game intro and the trailers. The script and shot list doc is the source: change both together.",
 "narrator": {
  "key": "narrator",
  "name": "Storyteller",
  "voice": "An old storyteller in his seventies, telling a fireside tale in a fantasy tavern. A warm, slightly gravelly baritone, slow and deliberate, with a smile in his voice and a dry, wry edge. He can drop to a near-whisper. Close and intimate, no room echo.",
  "takes": 3
 },
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "L1",
   "text": "Every tavern in Millbrook tells the same story."
  },
  {
   "id": "L2",
   "text": "Brave heroes ride out. Monsters fall. Gold comes home. Everyone cheers."
  },
  {
   "id": "L3",
   "text": "Funny thing about that story. It never says whose door they kicked in.",
   "say": "[chuckles] Funny thing about that story. It never says whose door they kicked in."
  },
  {
   "id": "L4",
   "text": "Millbrook pays by the head. Wolf pelts. Goblin ears. Anything that lives in the dark."
  },
  {
   "id": "L5",
   "text": "For a hundred years, the town grew fat on what its heroes carried home. And the wilds grew quiet.",
   "say": "For a hundred years, the town grew fat on what its heroes carried home... And the wilds grew quiet."
  },
  {
   "id": "L6",
   "text": "Too quiet.",
   "say": "[whispers] Too quiet."
  },
  {
   "id": "L7",
   "text": "Until something old remembered how to be angry."
  },
  {
   "id": "L8",
   "text": "A lich. A dragon. A prince of the Pit. Which one doesn't matter."
  },
  {
   "id": "L9",
   "text": "The monsters have no heroes. They have you."
  },
  {
   "id": "L10",
   "text": "You start small. Two servants. One lair. A tower nobody visits."
  },
  {
   "id": "L11",
   "text": "Win the wilds back with gold, with lies, or with your fists."
  },
  {
   "id": "L12",
   "text": "Then send them down the road, to the town that sent the heroes."
  },
  {
   "id": "L13",
   "text": "Burn Millbrook's hall, and the bounties stop."
  },
  {
   "id": "L14",
   "text": "Mind you, Millbrook won't make it easy. Its heroes get stronger every day."
  },
  {
   "id": "L15",
   "text": "And sooner or later, they'll come up your stairs."
  },
  {
   "id": "L16",
   "text": "Let them."
  },
  {
   "id": "L14b",
   "text": "Its heroes get stronger every day.",
   "trailer": true
  }
 ],
